{"1794670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Limited Rescue", "steam_appid": 1794670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaotic local multiplayer</h2>Throw your friends in the lava and be the last survivor when the rescue finally comes. <br>Fast and intuitive gameplay, up to 6 players on the same screen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/extras/7cca241ba944b60c291cdc0eee531bd6.poster.avif?t=1675529833\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/extras/7cca241ba944b60c291cdc0eee531bd6.webm?t=1675529833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/extras/7cca241ba944b60c291cdc0eee531bd6.mp4?t=1675529833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use different spells to be successful</h2>Choose and cast devastating spells. <br><strong>More than 10 different spells already available !</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/extras/spells.PNG?t=1675529833\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Super fast learning</h2>All you need is an analog stick and 4 buttons to turn your friends in smoking roasts. Limited Rescue is very intuitive but it takes practise to truly master the elements !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free for all or in teams</h2>Limited Rescue already offers 3 different game modes so that you can bbq your friends alone or in teams.<br><br><br>The game can be played with a keyboard but we highly recommend the use of gamepads (xbox, PS4, ...) to better enjoy the experience.<br>Limited Rescue is &quot;Remote Play&quot; compatible --&gt; Only one of you needs to buy the game and is then able to invite the whole squad to join through Steam, even remotely.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/extras/personnages.PNG?t=1675529833\" /></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaotic local multiplayer</h2>Throw your friends in the lava and be the last survivor when the rescue finally comes. <br>Fast and intuitive gameplay, up to 6 players on the same screen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/extras/7cca241ba944b60c291cdc0eee531bd6.poster.avif?t=1675529833\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/extras/7cca241ba944b60c291cdc0eee531bd6.webm?t=1675529833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/extras/7cca241ba944b60c291cdc0eee531bd6.mp4?t=1675529833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use different spells to be successful</h2>Choose and cast devastating spells. <br><strong>More than 10 different spells already available !</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/extras/spells.PNG?t=1675529833\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Super fast learning</h2>All you need is an analog stick and 4 buttons to turn your friends in smoking roasts. Limited Rescue is very intuitive but it takes practise to truly master the elements !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free for all or in teams</h2>Limited Rescue already offers 3 different game modes so that you can bbq your friends alone or in teams.<br><br><br>The game can be played with a keyboard but we highly recommend the use of gamepads (xbox, PS4, ...) to better enjoy the experience.<br>Limited Rescue is &quot;Remote Play&quot; compatible --&gt; Only one of you needs to buy the game and is then able to invite the whole squad to join through Steam, even remotely.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/extras/personnages.PNG?t=1675529833\" /></span>", "short_description": "The safe area is shrinking and only one may stand ! Use a variety of spells to push your friends in the hot lava and make sure you're the one getting rescued.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/header.jpg?t=1675529833", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1675529833", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1675529833", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-5257U, AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050, AMD RX 460 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64 bits OS and processor</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["LimitedRescue"], "publishers": ["LimitedRescue"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 199, "final": 199, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$1.99"}, "packages": [644399], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Limited Rescue", "description": "", "selection_text": "S